# This repository pins SHA-256 digests of exact file bytes: the embedded Codex
# app-server schemas (connector/internal/appserver/contracts), the generated
# schema package, the third-party license texts recorded in
# third_party/components.json, and the release manifests. Git's end-of-line
# conversion rewrites those bytes on checkout, which silently breaks every
# digest gate on Windows. Never let Git rewrite line endings here.
* -text
